Package: pico-dmx-controller
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: Pico DMX
Depends: adduser, php-cli (>= 2:8.1), policykit-1 | polkitd, util-linux, xdg-utils, libasound2t64 | libasound2, libatk1.0-0t64 | libatk1.0-0, libatk-bridge2.0-0t64 | libatk-bridge2.0-0, libcups2t64 | libcups2, libdrm2, libgbm1, libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0, libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0, libnss3, libx11-xcb1, libxcomposite1, libxdamage1, libxrandr2, libxss1
Recommends: ufw
Description: Browser-based WiFiPicoDMX lighting controller
 WiFiPicoDMX provides fixture setup, show programming, playback,
 MIDI control, and monitoring for Raspberry Pi Pico 2 W DMX interfaces.
 It includes a self-contained desktop application, runs as a local system
 service, and can optionally serve trusted LAN clients.
